                                                "text": "New guidance on how to prosecute abusive partners for controlling and coercive behaviour has highlighted the phenomenon of love-bombing, a tactic used by suspects to confuse victims and gain more control."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5eed6897-6571-382d-86f0-9d31045a7a2c",
