                                            "Someone with whom one dances in a two-person dance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a653a5de-1db2-492d-b44f-3baf569dc568",
                                                "sense_id": "5eed6897-6571-382d-86f0-9d31045a7a2c",
                                                "text": "He tried to persuade Cicely to stay away from the ball-room for a fourth dance.[…]But she said she must go back, and when they joined the crowd again her partner was haled off with a frightened look to the royal circle, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
